left(\\partial_r R + R\\,S'/S\\right)dr$, where $R\\,S'/S$ is the rate at which the centres of the spheres move along the axis toward $\\theta = 0$, so on this half of the axis neighbouring shells stand farther apart than on the other and the cones are narrower in $r$.","The marked ray is the last along this half of the axis to reach infinity. It leaves the centre at $ct = -0.81\\,r_b$ and crosses the surface at $0.61\\,r_b$, and outside the cloud, where $S$ is constant, it runs along the horizon of Schwarzschild's exterior in Georges Lemaître's coordinates."],"source":{"fields":["coords","parameters","metric_components","inverse_metric_components","kretschmann","domains","einstein_tensor"],"version":"b337e46bbdabbac9"}},{"id":"south","label":"the axis, $\\theta = \\pi$","plane":["t","r"],"families":["ingoing","outgoing"],"xlabel":"$r/r_b$","ylabel":"$ct/r_b$","ticks":{"x":[{"at":0.0,"label":"$0$"},{"at":0.25,"label":"$0.25$"},{"at":0.5,"label":"$0.5$"},{"at":0.75,"label":"$0.75$"},{"at":1.0,"label":"$1$"},{"at":1.25,"label":"$1.25$"},{"at":1.5,"label":"$1.5$"}],"y":[{"at":-0.5,"label":"$-0.5$"},{"at":-0.25,"label":"$-0.25$"},{"at":0.0,"label":"$0$"},{"at":0.25,"label":"$0.25$"},{"at":0.5,"label":"$0.5$"},{"at":0.75,"label":"$0.75$"},{"at":1.0,"label":"$1$"}]},"box":[0,1.5,-0.5,1.0],"to_display":[[0.0,1.0],[1.0,0.0]],"mirror":false,"rays":{"P":[[[0.0486,-0.0219],[0.0123,0.032],[-0.0208,0.0791]],[[0.1158,-0.0215],[0.0376,0.0885],[-0.0214,0.1662]],[[0.1835,-0.0207],[0.0525,0.1498],[0.015,0.1965],[-0.0205,0.2386]],[[0.2534,-0.0213],[0.1925,0.0483],[0.0504,0.2195],[0.0125,0.2628],[-0.0214,0.2995]],[[0.3241,-0.0209],[0.2801,0.02],[0.233,0.0683],[0.1874,0.1181],[0.0564,0.2659],[0.0154,0.3097],[-0.0216,0.3469]],[[0.3972,-0.0208],[0.3647,0.0025],[0.3313,0.0289],[0.2992,0.0566],[0.2644,0.089],[0.2029,0.1512],[0.0556,0.3078],[0.015,0.3485],[-0.0214,0.3829]],[[0.4702,-0.0201],[0.4227,0.0075],[0.3788,0.0364],[0.3367,0.0677],[0.2945,0.1029],[0.2593,0.1348],[0.2197,0.173],[0.0528